{"t":"The Ultimate Booze Quest","s":"the-ultimate-booze-quest-3b19a","k":"quest","i":"assets/wiki/The_Ultimate_Booze_Quest_aa52b9.png","q":2,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">The Ultimate Booze Quest</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Boozer Quest</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Tibia%20Tales\">Tibia Tales</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0<br/>(10 recommended)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.10<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 11, 2007<br/>Christmas Update 2007</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p>The recipe to make the legendary dwarven beer is a well kept secret.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Venore\">Venore</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Spider\">Spiders</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Wolf\">Wolves</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Bat\">Bats</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Rat\">Rats</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf\">Dwarves</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Light%20Shovel\">Light Shovel</a>, 10 <a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\">Platinum Coins</a>, 100  Experience Points\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Method\">Method</span></h3>\n<p>Go to <a href=\"#/wiki/Boozer\">Boozer</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Venore\">Venore</a>, above the <a href=\"#/wiki/Depot\">depot</a>, and ask him for a <b>mission</b>. He will tell you to go to <a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a> Brewery and fill a <a href=\"#/wiki/Empty%20Beer%20Bottle\">Bottle</a> with a special beer.\n</p><p>Go to Kazordoon. After you pass the part with the lava to enter the city, while you are in the part that has some Rats, go left instead of north, and follow the way up to the mountains.<br/>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"The Ultimate Booze Quest\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"319\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/The_Ultimate_Booze_Quest_aa52b9.png\" width=\"259\"/></span>\n</p><p><br/>\nOn the top floor, on the south-east corner, there will be a <a href=\"#/wiki/Cask%20of%20Brown%20Ale\">Cask of Brown Ale</a>. Fill the bottle with it and bring it back to Boozer to get your reward.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-none show-info-icon\" style=\"width: 332px\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> <img alt=\"UltimateBoozeCask\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"243\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/UltimateBoozeCask_6395f6.png\" width=\"332\"/> <figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> <svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg> </figcaption> </figure>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Boozer\">Boozer</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Venore\">Venore</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>hi</b><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Boozer\">Boozer</a>: Welcome to the Hard Rock Racing Track, <i>Player</i>.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>mission</b><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Boozer\">Boozer</a>: Shush!! I don't want everybody to know what I am up to. Listen, things are not going too well, I need a new attraction. Do you want to help me?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>yes</b><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Boozer\">Boozer</a>: Good! Listen closely. Take this bottle and go to <a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a>. I need a sample of their very special brown ale. You may find a cask in their brewery. Come back as soon as you got it.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>bye</b><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Boozer\">Boozer</a>: You'll be back.\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">The Ultimate Booze Quest</strong></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Return to <a href=\"#/wiki/Boozer\">Boozer</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>hi</b><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Boozer\">Boozer</a>: Welcome to the Hard Rock Racing Track, <i>Player</i>.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>mission</b><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Boozer\">Boozer</a>: Yessss! Now I only need to build my own small brewery, figure out the secret recipe, duplicate the dwarvish brew and BANG I'll be back in business! Here take this as a reward.<br/>\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">The Ultimate Booze Quest</strong></span>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div class=\"messagebox\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Go Forward Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"25\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Go_Forward_Icon_f12cec.png\" width=\"25\"/></span><figcaption></figcaption></figure><p style=\"font-weight: bold;\">See also:</p><br/><p><a href=\"#/wiki/Tibia%20Tales\">Tibia Tales</a></p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div></div></div>","quests":["loose-ends-quest","the-hidden-city-of-beregar-quest"]}